 "remarks": "5 Bed 3 Bath updated Colonial with large E-I-K with adjoining family room, formal dining room. Spacious Living room, hardwood floors. First floor bedroom with full bath or can be private office, Multiple other rooms and closets. Laundry can be on first floor or in basement. Perfect for multi-generational living. Additional full bath on first floor. Enormous lower level with bar and pool table. Three Season enclosed porch with skylights. Walk-out to grape covered pergola. Second floor features 4 large bedrooms with ample closet space in each room and full bath. Beautiful tree lined back yard with separate fenced off area for planting. Plenty of storage and parking. 2-Car Garage & covered parking and carport. Please review floor plan. Close to Beach, minutes to downtown Stamford yet in Darien.",
